Copyright 2026 tensorflow-java8-glibc-compat contributors

This project includes modified TensorFlow Java sources and rebuilt TensorFlow
Java JNI bridges. Compatibility modifications target Java 8 and the documented
Linux ABI baseline. Official TensorFlow C++ runtime libraries are redistributed
without modification. TensorFlow is developed by the TensorFlow contributors.

The release also includes JavaCPP and protobuf-java. Their original licenses,
copyright notices, and applicable third-party attributions are retained in the
artifact and collected release license materials.

This notice is informational and does not modify the licenses of the project or
its bundled components. The project is not an official TensorFlow distribution.
